# ---------- Third-party weight ----------
# The BSP driver layer is NOT pure third-party: drv_pdm.c registers the "mic0"
# audio device the whole project depends on, and drv_i2s.c shares its clock.
# If they are missing, every teammate silently falls back to the synthetic
# waveform in applications/m33/src/edgi_audio_capture.c and never notices.
#
# NOTE: git never re-includes anything inside an excluded *directory*, so
# /libraries cannot be excluded as a whole. Every heavy sub-tree is listed
# explicitly instead, which leaves HAL_Drivers trackable.
/libraries/components/
/libraries/Common/
/libraries/M33_Config/
/libraries/M55_Config/

# 162 MB of host-side tools (device configurator, fw tools); not buildable source
/tools

# ---------- Local scratch files ----------
_tmp_*
